      "text": "Place the Rook on a1.",
      "normalized": "place the rook on a1",
      "file": "audio/92b66451853a108c2c1f174b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the Rook on a8.",
      "normalized": "place the rook on a8",
      "file": "audio/5de4e22670e7b13c06bfd853.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the Rook on h1.",
      "normalized": "place the rook on h1",
      "file": "audio/8b836adfa53087f221c2a0f1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the Rook on h8.",
      "normalized": "place the rook on h8",
      "file": "audio/d923525d5124aa20ab4a8cea.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Queen",
      "normalized": "queen",
      "file": "audio/a9c3c1f7674502331a5ad3e5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rook",
      "normalized": "rook",
      "file": "audio/2c2b76080bad0b14e742ca55.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Select your piece, then tap a marked square.",
      "normalized": "select your piece then tap a marked square",
      "file": "audio/5ce22990031146404aaba7d0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stalemate",
      "normalized": "stalemate",
      "file": "audio/c71bfae2e39961e8922f3f3b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aim is to checkmate the other king. An attacked king is in check. If no legal move can escape the check, it is checkmate. Kings are never captured.",
      "normalized": "the aim is to checkmate the other king an attacked king is in check if no legal move can escape the check it is checkmate kings are never captured",
      "file": "audio/134ba636767581b7c3cd456a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The bishop moves any distance diagonally. It stays on the same colour and cannot jump over pieces.",
      "normalized": "the bishop moves any distance diagonally it stays on the same colour and cannot jump over pieces",
      "file": "audio/74f97287b1bf2d19a80c18a0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The board is ready! Each side has 16 pieces. White moves first.",
      "normalized": "the board is ready each side has 16 pieces white moves first",
      "file": "audio/51628ca0f271e122fccfb59b.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The king is attacked and has no legal move. Checkmate! The game ends.",
      "normalized": "the king is attacked and has no legal move checkmate the game ends",
      "file": "audio/29cccf147a31130d39629ccf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The king is attacked but has a safe move. The game continues.",
      "normalized": "the king is attacked but has a safe move the game continues",
      "file": "audio/6a5dbe1076ec223d86175118.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The king is not attacked but has no legal move. Stalemate! The game is a draw.",
      "normalized": "the king is not attacked but has no legal move stalemate the game is a draw",
      "file": "audio/b115d07627792189130749e1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The king moves one square in any direction. It cannot move onto an attacked square.",
      "normalized": "the king moves one square in any direction it cannot move onto an attacked square",
      "file": "audio/0afca0f02547be9e946fd2c0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The knight moves two squares in one direction and one to the side. It makes an L and can jump over pieces.",
      "normalized": "the knight moves two squares in one direction and one to the side it makes an l and can jump over pieces",
      "file": "audio/5d59b5d80c730236fddece23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn moves one square forward. On its first move it may move two if the path is clear. It captures one square diagonally forward. On the last rank it becomes a queen, rook, bishop or knight.",
      "normalized": "the pawn moves one square forward on its first move it may move two if the path is clear it captures one square diagonally forward on the last rank it becomes a queen rook bishop or knight",
      "file": "audio/da76b7e1539cfeee00a1a3e7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn promoted to: Bishop.",
      "normalized": "the pawn promoted to bishop",
      "file": "audio/5eb1709588d2de8fdebec3db.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn promoted to: Knight.",
      "normalized": "the pawn promoted to knight",
      "file": "audio/d52d45c0dc2e126b45604e08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn promoted to: Queen.",
      "normalized": "the pawn promoted to queen",
      "file": "audio/0a46d31f1f6e553b9e6a69da.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn promoted to: Rook.",
      "normalized": "the pawn promoted to rook",
      "file": "audio/0665d84abcc7f16a21d13971.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pawn reached the last rank and became a queen in this exercise.",
      "normalized": "the pawn reached the last rank and became a queen in this exercise",
      "file": "audio/e596c2cea71cc8803dd3322e.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The queen moves any distance horizontally, vertically or diagonally. It cannot jump over pieces.",
      "normalized": "the queen moves any distance horizontally vertically or diagonally it cannot jump over pieces",
      "file": "audio/d1c0e4853b26dc46e8cc2437.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The queen starts on her own colour: the white queen on a light square, the black queen on a dark square.",
      "normalized": "the queen starts on her own colour the white queen on a light square the black queen on a dark square",
      "file": "audio/86f7694ee193c74ae6cee78e.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rook moves any distance horizontally or vertically. It cannot jump over pieces.",
      "normalized": "the rook moves any distance horizontally or vertically it cannot jump over pieces",
      "file": "audio/ea839f63924ab371a46988cf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "text": "This move does not give checkmate. Try another move.",
      "normalized": "this move does not give checkmate try another move",
      "file": "audio/a037f26cac714791a18b2480.mp3"
